    "detailed_description": "Hundreds of packs, thousands of items. Can you collect them all?<br>Toybox is a Free To Play game about collecting anything and everything. <br>Check back daily for free packs, earn in-game currency and unlock mini-games, environments, props, and more!<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375800/extras/d1e176c15d691a64635528d301ce72f4.poster.avif?t=1615176840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375800/extras/d1e176c15d691a64635528d301ce72f4.webm?t=1615176840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375800/extras/d1e176c15d691a64635528d301ce72f4.mp4?t=1615176840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1000+ Items!</h2>With over 1000 items currently in the game, and new packs being released frequently, you'll never get bored!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Homes</h2>Display your items, customize your personal space, and invite friends over to play and hang out!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mini-Games</h2>Achieving certain goals and unlocking certain items and environments will allow you to access hidden mini-games that you can play by yourself or with friends!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Community-Driven</h2>We planned from the beginning of development to prepare for the game to be shaped and molded around what the community would like to see.<br>Any suggestions, comments, feedback, etc. should be redirected to our Discord, where we are active daily!",
